@startuml organization-process-boundary
title Organization / Process Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org
class "Process" as P

Org --> P : coordinates
Org -[dotted]- P : is NOT
P -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 7:
  Organization coordinates Processes. An Organization undertakes
  Processes, but an Organization is NOT a Process.
end note

@enduml
